(
    title: "Carnival",
    description: Some("A shooting-gallery port of Sega\'s arcade game: owls, rabbits and ducks parade across the rows while you slide your gun along the bottom, spending a strictly limited bullet supply. Ducks you miss dive down to eat ten bullets at a bite, extra-bullet boxes and a plus-minus target swing your stock and score, and clearing the pipes early keeps the duck swarms at bay."),
